replies.text:
@JohnBoozman @POTUS @SarahHuckabee FEMA's $55M for Arkansas must reach victims, not bureaucrats. Past disasters saw funds wasted on "consulting" & studies.

Hold agencies accountable - every dollar to rebuilding homes, not D.C. middlemen.

Recovery needs action, not empty promises.

@JohnBoozman We don't want our programs cut while you give tax breaks to the wealthy. 
Who's side are you on? The wealthy or your constituents?
The way you vote will tell everyone your answer.
